Hi Lyndal,

You can try:

library(dartR)
pcoa <- gl.pcoa(platypus.gl <http://platypus.gl>)
gl.pcoa.plot(glPca = pcoa,
             x= platypus.gl <http://platypus.gl>,
             interactive = TRUE)

To open the documentation of the function, type in the R console a question mark followed by the function name, as shown below:

?gl.pcoa.plot

Make sure you have the latest version of dartR, by typing in the R console:

install.packages("dartR")

Cheers,
Luis

